{
 "id": "Crush",
 "slug": "crush",
 "title": [
  "What If Your Crush’s Shadow Revealed Her Secret Feelings?"
 ],
 "tail": 2.5,
 "fps": 30,
 "shots": [
  {
   "id": "P1S1",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "What If Your Crush’s Shadow Revealed Her Secret Feelings?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S2",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Exactly 8:12 on Monday morning, you noticed something strange."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S3",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Your CRUSH was standing on the other side of the school hallway, chatting with her friends."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S4",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S5",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S6",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You immediately looked away."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S7",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Just another normal day."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S8",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But then you noticed something completely impossible."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S9",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow was waving at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S10",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You blinked."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S11",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She wasn't waving."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S12",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Both of her hands were still holding her books."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S13",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But her shadow?"
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S14",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It was waving like it had just spotted its favorite celebrity."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S15",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You stared at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S16",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The shadow pointed at you, then used both hands to make a heart."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S17",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You almost dropped your backpack."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S18",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked back at Emma."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S19",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She was still chatting with her friends, completely unaware of what her shadow was doing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S20",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You quickly walked into your classroom."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S21",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "There was no way you were going to spend the rest of the morning staring at someone's shadow."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S22",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "At least, that was the plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S23",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The first strange discovery"
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S24",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "During the first break, you were standing near the classroom window when Emma approached."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S25",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Hey, do you understand question five?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S26",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You turned around."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S27",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Uh… maybe. Let me see.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S28",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She handed you her notebook."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S29",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at the question, trying very hard to concentrate."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S30",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But then you noticed her shadow on the wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S31",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "While Emma was looking at the notebook, her shadow was leaning toward you with its hands clasped together."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S32",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It looked like it was waiting for something."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S33",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You glanced at Emma."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S34",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"What's wrong?\" she asked."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S35",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Nothing. I just… need to think.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S36",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow suddenly nodded enthusiastically."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S37",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked away."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S38",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "After explaining the question, Emma smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S39",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Thanks! I knew you'd understand it.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S40",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow immediately jumped into the air."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S41",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You nearly laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S42",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're welcome.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S43",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma walked back to her seat."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S44",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow turned around and gave you one final thumbs-up before following her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P1S45",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You were beginning to suspect that her shadow had a personality of its own."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S1",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The group project"
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S2",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "A few days later, your teacher announced a group assignment."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S3",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You were hoping to work with your usual friends."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S4",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Unfortunately, the teacher had other plans."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S5",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Emma and you will work together.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S6",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You tried to look calm."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S7",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S8",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma turned toward you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S9",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Looks like we're partners.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S10",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Yeah. Guess so.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S11",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S12",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow immediately threw both hands into the air."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S13",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You pretended not to notice."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S14",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "After class, you and Emma went to the library to plan the assignment."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S15",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She opened her laptop while you started writing down ideas."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S16",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"How about we make a presentation instead of a poster?\" she suggested."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S17",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"That could work.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S18",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"And maybe we can add a short video.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S19",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"That's actually a good idea.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S20",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She looked surprised."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S21",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Wow. You agreed with me twice.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S22",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S23",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Should I disagree just to make things interesting?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S24",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Please don't.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S25",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow was standing beside your chair."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S26",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It was giving you two thumbs-up."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S27",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You had to look away before Emma noticed you smiling."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S28",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Over the next few days, working together became surprisingly enjoyable."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S29",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma was organized but sometimes forgot small details."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S30",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You were good at solving problems but occasionally spent too much time worrying about minor things."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S31",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She teased you about it."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S32",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You teased her back."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S33",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "And somehow, the assignment that had initially seemed like a chore became the best part of your school week."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S34",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "One afternoon, you stayed late to finish the presentation."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S35",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The library was almost empty."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S36",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma stretched and looked at the clock."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S37",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Wow. We've been here for two hours.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S38",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Really? It felt like twenty minutes.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S39",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She looked at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S40",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"That's because you spent half the time choosing fonts.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S41",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Fonts are important.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S42",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Sure. Very important.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S43",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow was laughing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S44",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Not Emma."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S45",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The shadow."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S46",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It had both hands on its stomach, bending forward as if it couldn't stop laughing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S47",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You quickly looked down at your laptop."
  },
  {
   "id": "P2S48",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "This was getting ridiculous."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S1",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The rainy afternoon"
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S2",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The following Thursday, heavy rain started just as school ended."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S3",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Students rushed toward the entrance."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S4",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You stood under the roof, checking your phone and waiting for the rain to slow down."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S5",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then Emma appeared beside you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S6",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Do you have an umbrella?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S7",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You shook your head."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S8",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Unfortunately, no.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S9",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She held up a small blue umbrella."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S10",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Want to share?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S11",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at the umbrella."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S12",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then at Emma."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S13",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Are you sure?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S14",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Unless you want to swim home.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S15",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S16",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Okay. Fair enough.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S17",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The umbrella was small."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S18",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Very small."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S19",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You both had to walk close together to stay underneath it."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S20",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "At first, you tried to leave as much space between you as possible."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S21",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Which meant one of your shoulders was getting soaked."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S22",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma noticed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S23",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're getting wet.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S24",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I'm fine.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S25",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She moved the umbrella toward you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S26",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're really bad at sharing an umbrella.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S27",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S28",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're the one holding it.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S29",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Exactly. And I'm doing a terrible job.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S30",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You both laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S31",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But when you looked down, her shadow was doing something strange."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S32",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It was standing right beside yours, holding an imaginary umbrella over both of you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S33",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then it slowly leaned its head against your shoulder."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S34",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You almost walked into a puddle."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S35",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma looked at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S36",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Careful!\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S37",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Yeah. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S38",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You continued walking."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S39",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "A few minutes later, Emma suddenly asked:"
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S40",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Can I tell you something?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S41",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Sure.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S42",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're actually easier to talk to than I expected.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S43",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S44",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Was I difficult to talk to before?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S45",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S46",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"No. I just thought you were really quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S47",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You shrugged."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S48",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I'm usually quiet around people I don't know very well.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S49",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"And now?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S50",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S51",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Now I'm getting used to you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S52",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S53",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow immediately started jumping."
  },
  {
   "id": "P3S54",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You pretended to focus on the road."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S1",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The school festival"
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S2",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "A week later, the school announced its annual festival."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S3",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Every class had to prepare a small activity."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S4",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Your class decided to run a little game booth."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S5",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "And somehow, you and Emma ended up being responsible for decorating it."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S6",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "After school, you both stayed in the classroom with colorful paper, markers, tape, and a pile of cardboard."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S7",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma held up a sign."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S8",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Does this look good?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S9",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You tilted your head."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S10",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Maybe the letters should be bigger.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S11",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She narrowed her eyes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S12",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're very demanding for someone who hasn't done much.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S13",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I've been providing creative direction.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S14",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"That's a fancy way of saying you've been sitting there.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S15",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S16",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She threw a small piece of paper at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S17",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You picked it up and threw it back."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S18",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "For a few seconds, the classroom turned into a ridiculous paper battle."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S19",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then Emma laughed so hard that she had to sit down."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S20",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S21",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "And for a moment, you forgot about the decorations."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S22",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow was sitting beside her, laughing too."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S23",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It looked happier than ever."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S24",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Later, while you were cutting cardboard, you accidentally nicked your finger on a rough edge."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S25",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Ow.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S26",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma immediately looked over."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S27",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"What happened?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S28",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"It's nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S29",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She put down her marker and came closer."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S30",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Let me see.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S31",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She checked your finger and brought you a small bandage from her bag."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S32",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Here. Be careful next time.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S33",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Thanks.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S34",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S35",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You're supposed to help me finish the booth, not injure yourself.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S36",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S37",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow, however, had both hands on its cheeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S38",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It looked extremely worried."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S39",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then it carefully reached toward your hand."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S40",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You glanced at Emma."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S41",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She was already returning to the decorations."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S42",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You couldn't help smiling."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S43",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The misunderstanding"
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S44",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "On the day of the festival, everything was going well."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S45",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Your booth was busy."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S46",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma was laughing with the other students."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S47",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You were helping people play the game."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S48",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then, during a short break, you noticed Emma standing with Daniel."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S49",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The same Daniel who had been talking to her near the school gate."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S50",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "He handed her a drink."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S51",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled and thanked him."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S52",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked away."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S53",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You knew you had no reason to feel jealous."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S54",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But somehow, it still bothered you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S55",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then you looked at her shadow."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S56",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It wasn't celebrating."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S57",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It wasn't smiling."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S58",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It was looking directly at you with a disappointed expression."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S59",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then it pointed toward Emma and made a small gesture, as if asking you to come closer."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S60",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You hesitated."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S61",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Before you could decide what to do, Emma noticed you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S62",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Hey! Where did you go?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S63",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Nowhere. I was just getting some water.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S64",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She looked at you for a moment."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S65",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Are you okay?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S66",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Yeah. Why?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S67",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You've been quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S68",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You shrugged."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S69",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Just a little tired.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S70",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma nodded."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S71",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then she glanced at Daniel."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S72",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"He was just helping me carry the drinks. We ran out at the booth.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S73",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You felt slightly embarrassed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S74",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Oh. I see.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S75",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma looked at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S76",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Did you think something else?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S77",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You quickly shook your head."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S78",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"No.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S79",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S80",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S81",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But her shadow was now standing behind her, making an exaggerated facepalm."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S82",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You almost laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P4S83",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Apparently, even her shadow thought you were being ridiculous."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S1",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The moment she needed you"
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S2",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Later that afternoon, the festival became crowded."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S3",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma was responsible for collecting tickets at the entrance."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S4",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You were helping at the game booth."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S5",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then you noticed her standing alone near the side of the hall."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S6",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She was looking down at her phone."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S7",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Something seemed wrong."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S8",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You walked over."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S9",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Hey. Everything okay?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S10",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She looked up."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S11",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Oh. Yeah. I'm fine.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S12",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But her shadow was sitting on the floor with its head lowered."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S13",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It looked sad."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S14",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You didn't know what had happened, but you could tell she wasn't okay."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S15",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Want to take a break?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S16",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma hesitated."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S17",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then she nodded."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S18",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You found two empty chairs near the window."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S19",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "For a while, neither of you spoke."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S20",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then she finally said:"
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S21",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I think I messed something up.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S22",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"What happened?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S23",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I was supposed to prepare the tickets for the next activity, but I forgot to bring them.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S24",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You looked at her."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S25",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Is that all?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S26",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She nodded."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S27",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I know it's not a big deal, but everyone is depending on me.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S28",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S29",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Then let's fix it.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S30",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She looked surprised."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S31",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You'll help?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S32",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Of course.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S33",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You both went back to the classroom and quickly prepared the missing tickets."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S34",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "It took less than fifteen minutes."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S35",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "When you returned, Emma looked relieved."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S36",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Thank you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S37",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"No problem.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S38",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow suddenly jumped up and made a heart with both hands."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S39",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S40",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "For the first time that day, Emma looked genuinely happy again."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S41",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The confession"
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S42",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "After the festival ended, you and Emma walked outside together."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S43",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "The sky was turning orange."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S44",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Students were leaving in groups, carrying decorations and bags."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S45",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma was holding a small box of leftover supplies."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S46",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Today was exhausting,\" she said."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S47",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Definitely.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S48",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"But it was fun.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S49",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Yeah. Especially the paper fight.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S50",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S51",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I still can't believe you threw paper at me.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S52",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"You started it.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S53",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I did not!\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S54",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You both laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S55",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then the conversation slowly became quiet."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S56",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You had spent so much time together over the past few weeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S57",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You had worked on assignments, shared an umbrella, decorated a booth, and helped each other through a stressfu"
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S58",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "And every time, Emma's shadow had revealed something she never said out loud."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S59",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "But you still didn't know what Emma herself felt."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S60",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You finally decided to ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S61",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Emma?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S62",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Yeah?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S63",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Can I tell you something?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S64",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She turned toward you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S65",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Of course.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S66",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You took a breath."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S67",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I think I've started liking you.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S68",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma stopped walking."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S69",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You continued before you lost your courage."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S70",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Actually, I've liked you for a while. I just didn't know if you felt the same way.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S71",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "For a moment, she said nothing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S72",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then she looked down."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S73",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Her shadow immediately jumped up and started celebrating."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S74",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma slowly looked back at you."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S75",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"I like you too.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S76",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You blinked."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S77",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Really?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S78",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She nodded."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S79",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Really.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S80",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S81",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"So… does that mean we can go out sometime?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S82",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Emma laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S83",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Are you asking me out?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S84",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Maybe.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S85",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She smiled."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S86",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Then maybe my answer is yes.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S87",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "You both laughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S88",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "And just when you thought the day couldn't get any stranger, Emma suddenly looked down at the pavement."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S89",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Not at her own shadow."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S90",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "At yours."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S91",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "She stared at it for a few seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S92",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "Then she started laughing."
  },
  {
   "id": "P5S93",
   "size": "story",
   "note": "\"Your shadow is really nervous right now.\""
  }
